# Same Supabase project shop.pcbcare.in already uses. SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the
# public anon key — it's already shipped inside the shop app's JS bundle today,
# so putting it here doesn't expose anything new. Row Level Security on the
# Supabase side (not this file) is what actually controls what the anon key
# can read/write — confirm blog_posts, pages, and wiring_diagrams have RLS
# policies allowing public SELECT on status=eq.published rows only.

